=2 Walkthrough
* Activate the **blank target** (J-9) (the deactivated lamp) at the {p:Nyzul Isle Staging Point} which is right next to the Runic Portal(s) and select "Yes" to proceed with the mission.
* Check the Runic Seal (I-9), on the other side of the same large room, to enter the battlefield **Path of Darkness**.
** Trusts can be called during the battle.
* {p:Naja Salaheem} will fight with you during this battle.
** She must be kept alive, or the mission will end in failure.
** Recommend quick AoE action to pull hate on all the gears, they can kill Naja quickly, even at iLvl.
** Suggestion is to not run in and engage quickly, just aggro {n:Amnaf}. Let the gears spawn and then gather them all on you.
** With the adjustment to Trust Valaineral's Uriel Blade, he can quickly gain hate on the gears if you are on a job without AOE.
* The BC consists of three fights.
** If you fail, return to {n:Rodin-Comidin} in in Aht Urghan Whitegate for another key item to try again.

=4 Battle 1
* The first fight is against {n:Amnaf} and 4x {m:Imperial Gears|Imperial Gear}.
** The gears will not spawn until {n:Amnaf} is aggro'd.
** The gears can be {s:slept|Sleep}, but not very easily. They are however, susceptible to both {s:Gravity} and {s:Bind}. (Note: Unsurprisingly, this is very easy to do at ilvl at all steps.)
** {n:Amnaf} can be {s:slept|Sleep}.
** {p:Naja|Naja Salaheem} will pick one of the enemies at random to fight.
* Once defeated, {n:Amnaf} will {p:warp|Warp} one room over.
* {p:Naja|Naja Salaheem} will wait for a bit before heading into the next room.

=4 Battle 2
* The second fight is once again against {n:Amnaf} and 4x {m:Imperial Gears} (Triple Gears).
** The gears are much easier to sleep this time.
* {p:Naja|Naja Salaheem} will pick one of the enemies at random to fight.
* {n:Amnaf} gives up and {p:warps|Warp} away at about 25% {p:HP}.

=4 Battle 3
* This fight is against only {n:Amnaf}, but this time she turns into a {p:Soulflayer}.
** Her {p:Sleepga} resets hate on all players who are hit by it.
* Defeat {n:Amnaf} to finish the BC.

* Upon winning this Battlefield, you'll receive one last cutscene that completes this mission.

